<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.227 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.227 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 1.227 billion zlotys of Polish T-bills at the finance ministry's 1.4 billion zloty primaty auction, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Tender results should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
